'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape and a [[player card]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]], found on page two of the [[Righteous Revenants Legendary Warbond#Page 2|Righteous Revenants]] Premium [[Warbond]], can be claimed separately for {{Currency|Medals|25|notext}} and 7 [[Medal]]s.

==Trivia==
* Part of the content released in collaboration with ''Killzone 2'' for their crossover.
* The name of this cosmetic set, as well as the [[Strength in Our Arms]] cosmetic set, are both references to the speech of [https://killzone.fandom.com/wiki/Scolar_Visari Scolar Visari] from the intro cutscene of the first ''Killzone'' game.
* The Armory Description is a reference to a cutscene from ''Killzone 3''.<ref>https://killzone.fandom.com/wiki/Stahl_Arms_Infiltration/Transcript#Cutscene_#3</ref>
* Although originally slated for the second rotation of the crossover's ''Premium [[Superstore]]'', the items were ultimately given out as a holiday gift following backlash over the steep pricing of the first rotation.
** Players who got the items as a gift do not need to spend medals to unlock them in the Warbond, they are unlocked automatically.

